  levelIndex: 5
  displayName: "M\xE0n 5"
  placeName: "Th\xE1p Nh\u1ECBp"
  rulerSeconds: 30
  entryTier: 1
  tierCap: 3
  objective: "T\u1EA7ng 1: l\u1EEBa NH\u1ECAP canh nh\u1EA7m c\u1EEDa. T\u1EA7ng
    2: d\xF9ng \u1EA2nh v\u1ECDng k\xE9o m\u1EAFt th\xE1p \u0111i, giao th\u01B0
    v\xE0o khe th\u1EADt (G28, l\xE0n xa)."
  startLine: "\u0110\xE2y l\xE0 th\xE1p c\u1EE7a t\xF4i. M\u1ED7i b\u01B0\u1EDBc
    anh \u0111i trong n\xE0y, t\xF4i \u0111\u1EC1u \u0111\xE3 h\u1ECDc \u1EDF b\u1ED1n
    n\u01A1i tr\u01B0\u1EDBc."
  tierUpLines:
  - 
  - 
  - "\u0110\xE3 ghi nh\u1EADn. T\xF4i ch\u1EB7n c\u1EEDa anh v\u1EEBa ch\u1ECDn."
  - "T\xF4i \u0111\u1EE7 d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u \u0111\u1EC3 \u0111o\xE1n anh. B\xF3ng
    c\u1EE7a anh s\u1EBD \u0111i tr\u01B0\u1EDBc \u2014 v\xE0 m\u1EAFt t\xF4i \u0111i
    theo n\xF3."
  ghostLine: "T\xF4i kh\xF3a m\u1EAFt v\xE0o b\xF3ng c\u1EE7a anh. B\xF3ng \u0111i
    \u0111\xE2u, tia \u0111\u1ECF theo \u0111\xF3."
  zones:
  - name: L5_Cua
    fromTime: 0
    toTime: 9.4
    hint: "H\xE0nh lang ch\u1EC9 \u0111\u1ED5i l\xE0n \u1EDF ng\xE3 ba G2. \u0110i
      l\xE0n g\u1EA7n t\u1EDBi c\u1EEDa gi\u1EA3 G9, \u0111\u1EE9ng y\xEAn 2 gi\xE2y
      cho NH\u1ECAP nh\xECn, r\u1ED3i l\xF9i m\u1ED9t m\u1EA1ch v\u1EC1 G2 \u2014
      NH\u1ECAP s\u1EBD ch\u1EB7n l\xE0n g\u1EA7n. Sau \u0111\xF3 \u0111\u1ED5i sang
      l\xE0n xa \u1EDF ng\xE3 ba."
  - name: L5_Thang
    fromTime: 9.4
    toTime: 12.5
    hint: "C\u1EA7u thang l\xEAn t\u1EA7ng 2 \u1EDF l\xE0n xa. Th\xF9ng th\u01B0
      gi\u1EEFa \u1EDF G13."
  - name: L5_Hall
    fromTime: 16
    toTime: 21
    hint: "C\u1ED9t s\xE1ng \u1EDF G18 \u0111\xE1nh v\xE0o l\xE0n NH\u1ECAP nh\u1EDB
      (v\xF2ng \u0111\u1ECF). \u0110i l\xE0n c\xF2n l\u1EA1i."
  - name: L5_Mat
    fromTime: 21
    toTime: 30
    hint: "\u1EDE b\u1EADc 3, tia \u0111\u1ECF G22\u201327,5 kh\xF3a v\xE0o \u1EA2nh
      v\u1ECDng. L\xF9i m\u1ED9t m\u1EA1ch tr\xEAn t\u1EA7ng 2 (vd G27 v\u1EC1 G16)
      \u0111\u1EC3 g\u1ECDi b\xF3ng, r\u1ED3i \u0111i l\xE0n KH\xC1C l\xE0n c\u1EE7a
      b\xF3ng. Khe th\u1EADt \u1EDF G28 l\xE0n xa ch\u1EC9 m\u1EDF khi b\xF3ng \u0111ang
      \u0111i."
  marks:
  - time: 2
    label: "Ng\xE3 ba"
    lane: -1
  - time: 9
    label: "C\u1EEDa gi\u1EA3 / c\u1EEDa th\u1EADt"
    lane: -1
  - time: 13
    label: "Th\xF9ng th\u01B0 gi\u1EEFa"
    lane: -1
  - time: 18
    label: "C\u1ED9t s\xE1ng"
    lane: -1
  - time: 22
    label: "Tia kh\xF3a"
    lane: -1
  - time: 25
    label: "\xD4 l\u1EF1a ch\u1ECDn"
    lane: -1
  - time: 28
    label: "Khe th\u01B0"
    lane: 1
  ghostSpeedFactor: 0.6
  solution: "T\u1EA6NG 1: 1) \u0110i l\xE0n g\u1EA7n t\u1EDBi c\u1EEDa gi\u1EA3 G9
    (G9,2\u20139,4), \u0111\u1EE9ng y\xEAn 2 gi\xE2y. 2) L\xF9i m\u1ED9t m\u1EA1ch
    v\u1EC1 G2 (b\u1EADc 2, NH\u1ECAP ch\u1ED1t l\xE0n g\u1EA7n, thanh ch\u1EAFn
    chuy\u1EC3n sang l\xE0n g\u1EA7n, c\u1EEDa th\u1EADt l\xE0n xa m\u1EDF). 3) \u1EDE
    ng\xE3 ba G2 \u0111\u1ED5i sang l\xE0n xa, \u0111i l\xEAn c\u1EA7u thang G9,5\u201312.\nT\u1EA6NG
    2: 4) Qua th\xF9ng th\u01B0 gi\u1EEFa G13, nh\u1EB7t th\xF9ng \u1EDF G14,5. 5)
    \u0110i l\xE0n xa qua c\u1ED9t s\xE1ng G18 (n\xF3 \u0111\xE1nh l\xE0n g\u1EA7n
    khi ch\u01B0a nh\u1EDB g\xEC). 6) Mu\u1ED1n K\u1EBET L\u1EB6NG: \u0111\u1EB7t
    th\xF9ng l\xEAn \xF4 v\xE0ng G25 \u1EDF l\xE0n xa r\u1ED3i nh\u1EA3y qua (Space).
    Mu\u1ED1n K\u1EBET V\u1ECCNG: c\u1EE9 c\u1EA7m th\xF9ng ho\u1EB7c \u0111\u1EC3
    \u1EDF ch\u1ED7 kh\xE1c, \u0111\u1EEBng ch\u1EB7n \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng. 7) \u0110i
    t\u1EDBi G27 r\u1ED3i l\xF9i m\u1ED9t m\u1EA1ch v\u1EC1 G16 (b\u1EADc 3 > \u1EA2nh
    v\u1ECDng xu\u1EA5t hi\u1EC7n, \u0111i l\u1EA1i \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng l\xE0n xa).\n8)
    \u0110\u1ED5i sang l\xE0n g\u1EA7n, \u0111i qua G18 v\xE0 v\xF9ng tia G22\u201327,5
    (tia kh\xF3a v\xE0o b\xF3ng \u1EDF l\xE0n xa). 9) Qua G27,6 th\xEC \u0111\u1ED5i
    sang l\xE0n xa, t\u1EDBi khe th\u1EADt G28 v\xE0 b\u1EA5m E. B\xF3ng b\u1ECB
    th\xF9ng ch\u1EB7n > K\u1EBFt L\u1EB7ng; b\xF3ng \u0111i h\u1EBFt \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng
    > K\u1EBFt V\u1ECDng."
